Hi Jing,

The same intercept ordering restrictions do not apply to the GPCM family. You can generate these values to be basically anything. For a reasonable range of values that really depends on what you are trying to emulate. Perhaps find some simulation articles that used this model and try to emulate the results in mirt (in case they use the classical IRT paramerization see the function traditional2mirt()). HTH.

Phil

